---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Jay Home Buyers';
const description =
  'How Jay Home Buyers collects, uses and protects the personal information you share when you ask for a cash offer on your property.';
const contact = site.email || 'the contact details on this website';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you fill out our form, call, or text us, we collect the information you give us: your name,
        phone number, the property address and province, and details about the property such as its
        condition, whether it is listed, who lives there, and your timeline. We also record which page of
        this website you sent the form from.
      </p>
      <p>
        Like most websites, we may use analytics and advertising tools (Google Analytics and the Meta
        Pixel) that collect information about how you use the site, such as pages visited and the type of
        device you use. These tools use cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To review your property and contact you by phone or text about an offer.</li>
        <li>To understand which pages of our website are helpful, and to show our ads to people who have visited it.</li>
        <li>
          If buying your property ourselves isn’t the right fit, and only with your permission, to connect you
          with a real estate professional who may be able to help.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>
        We use service providers to run this website, receive form submissions and store our records. They
        handle your information only to provide those services to us. Some of these providers may store
        information outside Canada, where it may be subject to the laws of that country.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep your information only as long as we need it for the purposes above, or as required by law.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us to stop contacting you at any time, including by replying STOP to a text. You can also
        ask to see the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, by
        contacting us at {contact}.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this policy or how we handle your information, contact us at {contact}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
